<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>

<ContentPage xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/dotnet/2021/maui"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2009/xaml"
             xmlns:controls="clr-namespace:Elpida.Mobile.Controls"
             xmlns:strings="clr-namespace:Elpida.Mobile"
             x:Class="Elpida.Mobile.Pages.About">
    <ContentPage.Content>
        	
        <ScrollView>
            <VerticalStackLayout Padding="8">
                <Image Source="elpida_logo.png"/>
                <Label Style="{StaticResource Header2}">
                    In brief
                </Label>
                <Label>
                    Elpida is an open and free benchmarking framework aiming to provide a transparent way to benchmark algorithms/systems with no closed source components. This way everything is benchmarked on equal ground with no result skews. The website/Http Api was created to store anonymously results so that users can compare similar systems as well as create statistics. The benchmarks try to be as varied as possible and use real-world libraries. This is to avoid making the results biased towards specific vendors or architectures.
                </Label>
                <Label Style="{StaticResource Header2}" Text="{x:Static strings:Resources.MoreInfo}"/>
                <controls:Hyperlink Style="{StaticResource Header2}" Text="https://www.elpida.dev" Url="https://www.elpida.dev" />
            </VerticalStackLayout>
        </ScrollView>
    </ContentPage.Content>
</ContentPage>